Its core work extends to the construction and reconstruction of power supply systems, covering projects from new power network installations through to upgrading or rebuilding existing infrastructure that has reached the end of its working life. Based in Salieshoek, Pretoria, WL Engineering suits industrial and commercial clients needing power network design, construction or ongoing electrical equipment maintenance from an established contractor with three decades in the field.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://wlengineering.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'wl-engineering-electrical-contractor-salieshoek' AND description = 'WL Engineering is an electrical and mechanical engineering contractor founded in 1994 in Pretoria, handling power network design, maintenance and repair of electrical equipment, and construction and reconstruction of power supply systems.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
